        "id": "eci_8",
        "name": "Sex and contraceptive/barrier requirements",
        "text": "Males, WOCBP, or WNOCBP may participate in this trial. Contraceptive use by participants should be consistent with local regulations regarding the methods of contraception for those participating in clinical studies. For the contraception requirements of this protocol, see Section 10.4. Note: the word \"male\" is used to describe an individual assigned male at birth (AMAB) and the word \"female\" is used to describe an individual assigned female at birth (AFAB), for simplicity.",
        "instanceType": "EligibilityCriterionItem"
      },
