        "name": "Prior or planned surgical treatment for obesity",
        "text": "Have a prior or planned surgical treatment for obesity. Exceptions: The following are allowed if they occurred >1 year before screening (Visit 1): liposuction; cryolipolysis; or abdominoplasty.",
